# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for `pnpm start`; deployed, each is `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
# `pnpm types` reads this file: what's set here is required. The commented ones are optional, typed in
# env.optional.d.ts, and show as "Not set up" in Settings until set.

# `pnpm start` has no Cloudflare Access in front of it: sign every request in as this email. Never deployed.
# KY_DEV=1
# KY_DEV_EMAIL=you@example.com
# ACCESS_EMAILS=you@example.com

# VibeProxy's x-api-key; with VIBEPROXY and VIBEPROXY_ORIGIN in wrangler.local.jsonc.
# VIBEPROXY_KEY=
